    |-------------------------------------------------------------------|
    |                 |                   | 00 = bypass for OR output   |
    |     17:16       |   SEL_BIT4_TYPE2  | 01 = bypass for AND output  |
    |                 |                   | 10 = sense input '0' is true|
    |                 |                   | 11 = sense input '1' is true|
    |-------------------------------------------------------------------|
    |                 |                   | 00 = bypass for OR output   |
